e design","product design","2023-02-01","### Design Background\nBazzaal Box brings the best of K-Beauty to the world through creator-led curations. Unlike traditional subscription services, Bazzaal operates on a \"drop\" model, requiring a versatile \"one-size-fits-all\" design system that adapts to diverse product lineups for every launch. I designed a packaging identity that ensures a share-worthy unboxing experience while maintaining structural durability for international shipping, regardless of the collection's theme.\n","\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-2-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main-logo-bbox.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-row\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-4\"> \n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main3x4.webp\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-4\">\n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/box-model.webp\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-scroll\">\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-2.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-4.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-3.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main1x1-b.png\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-1.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/boxgrid-hq.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>","src/content/posts/260214 bazzaalbox.md","e3264dcfa0dd9ba9",{"html":31,"metadata":32},"\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-2-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main-logo-bbox.webp\">\n\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-row\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-4\"> \n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main3x4.webp\">\n  \u003C/div>\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-4\">\n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/box-model.webp\">\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-scroll\">\n      \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-2.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\">\n    \u003C/div>\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-4.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\">\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-3.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\">\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main1x1-b.png\" class=\"my-carousel-img\">\n    \u003C/div>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-1.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\">\n    \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/boxgrid-hq.webp\">\n\u003C/div>",{"headings":33,"localImagePaths":34,"remoteImagePaths":35,"frontmatter":11,"imagePaths":36},[],[],[],[],"260214 bazzaalbox.md","260215-vt-cosmetics",{"id":38,"data":40,"body":51,"filePath":52,"digest":53,"rendered":54,"legacyId":74},{"title":41,"format":13,"description":42,"image":43,"category":44,"tags":47,"date":49,"intro":50},"VT Cosmetics","Secret Society - Exclusive Beauty Event","/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/thumb.webp",[45,17,46],"Event","Illustration",[20,21,22,23,48],"event identity","2025-04-06","### VT Cosmetics: Secret Society\nAn invitation-only event held in Los Angeles and New York, centered around the theme of hidden beauty rituals. The 'Secret Recipe', a unique pairing of products for glowing skin was introduced through artistic illustrations that captivated an audience of 100+ top beauty influencers. This creative approach transformed product education into a visual journey, accumulating 24M+ social media reach.\n","\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-2-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/main-title.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003C/br>\n\n#### Invitaion Box Design\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/vt-package3.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-row\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\"> \n\u003Cvideo\n  class=\"my-carousel-img\"\n  src=\"/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/package-vid.mp4\"\n  loop\n  playsinline\n  muted  >\u003C/video>\n  \u003C/div>\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/vt-package1.webp\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-scroll\">\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/vt-package2b.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/vt-package4.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003C/br>\n\n#### Product Display / Illustration\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/vt-vibe6.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel marquee-mode\" style=\"--marquee-gap: -10px;\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-scroll marquee-track\">\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260215 VT cosmetics/tablematt1-2.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u0