,[48,84,85,86],"graphic design","visual design","exhibition","### Introduction\nThe 10,000 Buddha Relics Exhibition is the largest display of Buddhist treasures in the United States, established in 2013. The collection features a vast array of sacred relics sourced from various Asian countries, including Myanmar, Thailand, Sri Lanka, and Vietnam. To ensure an accessible experience for international visitors, translation services and materials are provided in six languages: English, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Vietnamese, and Spanish.\n","\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-2-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/topbanner2.png\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-row\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/entrance-3.webp\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/poster1.webp\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/front.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/window.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel marquee-mode\" style=\"--marquee-gap: -10px;\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-scroll marquee-track\">\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/marquee1.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/marquee1.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-2-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/crossroad.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>","src/content/posts/260221 Relics.md","9292f373ba74432a",{"html":92,"metadata":93},"\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-2-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260221 Relics/topbanner2.png\">\n\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-row\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"im